1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,500
[A] Alright, we're rolling. The street is quiet tonight, just the way we planned it.

2
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:10,250
[B] Quiet is good. Last time the corner was crawling with onlookers before we even started.

3
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:15,250
[C] I brought the chalk. We can mark the lines before the crowd shows up.

4
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:19,750
[A] Mark them wide. Nobody should be guessing where the boundary is.

5
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:24,000
[B] And the water table? Somebody has to keep the bottles on ice.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,250
[C] I already filled the cooler. Ice, towels, and a spare roll of tape.

7
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:33,500
[A] Good. Now we just wait for the lights to come on over the alley.

8
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:37,250
[B] When they do, we walk in steady. No rush, no noise.

9
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:42,250
[C] Steady wins. The ones who rush always trip on the first line.

